Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: ApplicationSet Not Creating Applications
Symptoms: ApplicationSet exists but no Applications are created

Solution:

# Check ApplicationSet controller logs
kubectl logs -n argocd deployment/argocd-applicationset-controller

# Verify ApplicationSet status
kubectl describe applicationset guestbook-applicationset -n argocd
Issue 2: Applications Stuck in Sync State
Symptoms: Applications show "Syncing" status for extended periods

Solution:

# Force sync an application
argocd app sync <application-name>

# Check application events
kubectl describe application <application-name> -n argocd
Issue 3: Namespace Creation Issues
Symptoms: Applications fail to deploy due to missing namespaces

Solution:

# Manually create namespaces
kubectl create namespace guestbook-dev
kubectl create namespace guestbook-staging
kubectl create namespace guestbook-prod

# Or ensure CreateNamespace=true in syncOptions
Issue 4: Git Repository Access Issues
Symptoms: Applications cannot access the Git repository

Solution:

# For private repositories, create a secret
kubectl create secret generic git-secret \
  --from-literal=username=<username> \
  --from-literal=password=<token> \
  -n argocd

# Add repository to ArgoCD
argocd repo add <repo-url> --username <username> --password <token>
